### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).
### Run "backend: run server" (or docker compose up) first, then click "Send Request"
### above each block below. Seeded demo login from scripts/seed.py.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### Login (seeded demo customer)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "aniket@throttle.aero",
  "password": "NeoSky@123"
}

### Dashboard (uses the access token from the login response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### My drones
GET {{baseUrl}}/drones
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Flight log stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Customer-isolation check: log in as the second seeded customer, then
### try requesting drone/ticket ids that belong to the first customer above
### (paste an id from the /drones or /tickets response) — expect 404.
# @name login2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "owner@skyfleet.example",
  "password": "NeoSky@123"
}

### Replace {{droneIdFromCustomer1}} with a real id, then send — expect 404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/drones/{{droneIdFromCustomer1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.access_token}}
